From 06b6a67618618edc192a8fe4de566f61fce58103 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yoav Weiss <yoavweiss@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 11 May 2026 05:02:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [Backport] Dependency for CVE-2026-118353 (2/4)

Manual cherry-pick of patch originally reviewed on
https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7685815:
Speculative load measurement - preload early hints

https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7715319 added
performance.speculations.preloads, based on
https://github.com/WICG/speculative_load_measurement.

This CL expands support for Early Hints, to make sure their reported
values match their attributes.

Co-Authored-By: AI (Claude Opus 4.6)
Bug: 493637574
Change-Id: Ib82ba3c1b0275e8396cb6055971f12210af710cb
